MID_H_Sys_Hp: Unit's health. Unit is retired when\nthe gauge drops to 0.
MID_Sys_Str: Str
MID_H_Sys_Str: Strength. Affects damage the unit\ndeals with physical attacks.
MID_Sys_Mag: Mag
MID_H_Sys_Mag: Magic. Affects damage the unit\ndeals with magical attacks.
MID_Sys_Tec: Dex
MID_H_Sys_Tec: Dexterity. Determines hit rate\nand frequency of critical hits.
MID_Sys_Spd: Spd
MID_H_Sys_Spd: Speed. Contributes to Avo.\nAlso affects attack speed.
MID_Sys_Lck: Lck
MID_H_Sys_Lck: Luck. Has various effects, including\nlowering risk of enemy criticals.
MID_Sys_Def: Def
MID_H_Sys_Def: Defense. Reduces damage\nfrom physical attacks.
MID_Sys_Res: Res
MID_H_Sys_Res: Resistance. Reduces damage\nfrom magical attacks.
MID_Sys_Cha: Cha
MID_H_Sys_Cha: Charm. Raises gambits' hit rate.
MID_Sys_Mov: Mov
MID_H_Sys_Mov: Movement. Determines how\nmany spaces a unit can move.
MID_H_Sys_HPStock: When unit's HP reaches 0,\nconsumes one rank to fully restore\nits HP.
MID_Sys_Attack: Atk
MID_H_Sys_Attack: The offensive power of the unit's\nphysical or magical attacks.
MID_Sys_Physicalattack: Phys
MID_H_Sys_Physicalattack: Physical attack. The unit's attack\npower using a physical weapon.
MID_Sys_Magicattack: Mys
MID_H_Sys_Magicattack: Mystical attack. The unit's attack\npower using magic or a magic\nweapon.
MID_Sys_Otherattack: Spec
MID_H_Sys_Otherattack: Special attack power that is not\naffected by foe's Prt or Rsl.
MID_Sys_Power: Mt
MID_Sys_Recovery: Rec
MID_H_Sys_Recovery: The amount of HP the unit's target\nwill recover when healed.
MID_Sys_HealPower: Pwr
MID_H_Sys_HealPower: Weapon's recovery magic power.
MID_Sys_Hit: Hit
MID_H_Sys_Hit: Hit rate. Determines the\nodds of landing an attack.
MID_Sys_Attackspeed: AS
MID_H_Sys_Attackspeed: Attack Speed. If at least 4 higher\nthan foe's, unit can make a\nfollow-up attack.
MID_Sys_Avoid: Avo
MID_H_Sys_Avoid: Avoid rate. Determines the odds of\nevading an attack.
MID_Sys_Secure: Ddg
MID_H_Sys_Secure: Dodge. Determines the odds of\navoiding a critical hit.
MID_Sys_Critical: Crit
MID_H_Sys_Critical: Critical rate. Determines the odds\nof landing a critical hit (triple\ndamage).
MID_Sys_Protection: Prt
MID_H_Sys_Protection: Protection. Reduces damage\nfrom physical attacks. Benefits\nfrom Shld.
MID_Sys_Enduremagic: Rsl
MID_H_Sys_Enduremagic: Resilience. Reduces damage\nfrom magical attacks. Benefits\nfrom Shld.
MID_Sys_Rng: Rng
MID_H_Sys_Rng: Range. Distance from which the\nunit can attack an enemy.
MID_Sys_Phy: Bld
MID_H_Sys_Phy: Build. Reduces attack speed cost of\nheavy weapons and equipment.
