MID_Restart_Battle_Comment: You can restart this battle while retaining any experience gained.
MID_Restart_Battle_Annotation: You will return to the state before starting the battle.
MID_Restart_Battle_Yes: Yes (Don't Retain Exp)
MID_Restart_Battle_Yes_Exp: Yes (Retain Exp)
MID_Restart_BeforeBattle: Restart from before Battle
MID_Restart_BeforeBattle_Help: Return to the state before taking on the battle.
MID_Restart_BeforeBattle_Disable: You cannot select this because you entered the battle with\nno turns remaining.
MID_Restart_BeforeBattle_Confirm: Restart from the state before taking on the battle?
MID_Restart_Chapter: Restart Chapter
MID_Restart_Chapter_Help: Restart from the beginning of the current chapter.
MID_Restart_Chapter_Confirm: Restart this chapter?
MID_Restart_Chapter_Annotation: Unit stats, inventory, and so forth will return to their\nstate from the beginning of the chapter.
MID_Restart_Chapter_Part3: Restart Section
MID_Restart_Chapter_Part3_Help: Restart from the beginning of the current section.
MID_Restart_Chapter_Part3_Confirm: Restart this section?
MID_Restart_Chapter_Part3_Annotation: Unit stats, inventory, and so forth will return to their\nstate from the beginning of the section.
MID_Restart_Hellgate: Restart from Gate Mission
MID_Restart_Hellgate_Help: Restart from the beginning of the current section's\ngate destruction mission.
MID_Restart_Hellgate_Confirm: Restart from the beginning of the gate destruction mission?
MID_Restart_Hellgate_Annotation: Unit stats, inventory, and so forth will return to their\nstate from the beginning of the gate destruction mission.
MID_Restart_Dit8Search: Retry the Cetus Hunt
MID_Restart_Dit8Search_Help: Restart from the beginning of the hunt for Cetus.
MID_Restart_Dit8Search_Confirm: Restart the hunt for Cetus?
MID_Restart_Dit8Search_Annotation: Restart from the beginning of the hunt for Cetus.
MID_Restart_UseHistory: Use Fortuna's Blessing
MID_Restart_UseHistory_Help: Rewind time to redo your turns.
MID_Restart_UseHistory_Annotation: You do not have enough Divine Sand.
MID_Restart_ReturnObelisk: Return to the Obelisk Chamber
MID_Restart_ReturnObelisk_Help: Give up on current progress and return to the Obelisk\nChamber. (You can restart from the beginning of\nthe chapter or explore another path.)
MID_Restart_ReturnObelisk_Confirm: Return to the Obelisk Chamber?
MID_Restart_ReturnObelisk_Annotation: When you resume {Variable=0}, you will start from the\nbeginning of this chapter.
MID_Restart_ReturnObelisk_Part3: Obelisk Chamber
MID_Restart_ReturnObelisk_Part3_Help: Give up on current progress and return to the Obelisk\nChamber. (You can secure causality for a Flame Lord\nor restart this section.)
MID_Restart_ReturnObelisk_Part3_Confirm: Return to the Obelisk Chamber?
MID_Restart_ReturnObelisk_Part3_Annotation: When you come back to the Salvation Arc, you will start from the\nbeginning of the current section.
MID_Restart_ReturnObelisk_Part3_Chapter1_Annotation: Return to the state before starting the Salvation Arc.
MID_Restart_ReturnObelisk_Hellgate: Obelisk Chamber
MID_Restart_ReturnObelisk_Hellgate_Help: Give up on current progress and return to the Obelisk\nChamber. (You can secure causality for a Flame Lord\nor restart the gate destruction mission.)
MID_Restart_ReturnObelisk_Hellgate_Confirm: Return to the Obelisk Chamber?
MID_Restart_ReturnObelisk_Hellgate_Annotation: When you come back to the Salvation Arc, you will start from the\nbeginning of the current section's gate mission.
MID_Restart_ReturnTitle: Return to Title
MID_Restart_ReturnTitle_Help: Return to the title screen.
MID_Restart_ReturnTitle_Confirm: Return to the title screen without saving your data?
