MID_Title_Continue: Continue
MID_Title_Continue_Help: Load previously saved data.
MID_Title_ContinueNewGame: Descend Again
MID_Title_ContinueNewGame_Help: Replay the prologue to remake your body while\nmaintaining your progress on each path. You can\nalso change the difficulty settings.
MID_Title_ContinueNewGame_Confirm: Maintain the progress from current save data and\nreplay the prologue?
MID_Title_ContinueNewGame_Comment: You will start with set stats. Upon reaching the Obelisk Chamber,\nyou will regain the stats you had from before descending again.
MID_Title_ContinueNewGame_Attention: To begin a new game without preserving your progress,\nplease delete your save data under Extras.
MID_Title_ContinueNewGame_Condition_Message: To use Descend Again, your game must be saved while in the\nObelisk Chamber. Select Continue to resume play, then \nreturn to the Obelisk Chamber and save again.
MID_Title_Extra: Extras
MID_Title_Extra_Help: Configure game settings and more.
MID_Title_SettingVoice: Voice Language
MID_Title_SettingVoice_Help: This is the language setting for the voice across the game.
MID_Title_SettingVoice_Jp: Japanese
MID_Title_SettingVoice_En: English
MID_Title_SettingBug: Enemy Masking
MID_Title_SettingBug_Help: This is the display setting for certain insectile enemies\nacross the game. When turned ON, these enemies will\nappear differently.
MID_Title_SaveDelete: Delete Save Data
MID_Title_SaveDelete_Help: Completely delete your save data. (You will be able to start\nthe game over from the beginning without carrying over\nany data.)
MID_Title_SaveDelete_Confirm: Do you want to delete your save data?
MID_Title_SaveDelete_Attention: Progress for each path will be lost.
MID_Title_SaveDelete_Reconfirm: This action cannot be undone. Are you sure?
MID_Title_SaveDelete_Result: Save data deleted.
MID_Title_Continue_RollBack_Confirm: This will revert your save in order to resume play from an earlier point.\nAre you sure?
MID_Title_Continue_RollBack_Comment: If your save data is in a state where progression is impossible,\nthis may resolve the issue.
MID_Title_Continue_RollBack_Attention: The progress made in this chapter or section will reset.
